From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:25:17 +0000
Subject: fix(android): replay IME height to replacement keyboard listeners

KRKeyboardModule keeps a main-thread-only listener registry that replays
the last IME height to listeners registered after the keyboard is already
up (e.g. a text field recreated while focused), and enforces main-thread
access. KRTextFieldView dedups height dispatch per listener through
KeyboardHeightDispatchGate instead of a field-wide last height, so a
replacement listener still receives the current height.

Fork-Patch: android-ime-height-replay
